// Installed name: TEST - G3B File Caller
// Purpose/role: Observe actual native PDF return through Run Shortcut; independent generation diagnostic.
// Specification revision: 1; interface 1.0. Contract: Select one disposable PDF; returned type must match baseline and full PDF remains usable; no explicit return
// Dependencies: TEST - G3 Exit Echo interface 1.0. Exact installed targets must match source; export filenames do not set installed names.
// Side effects: Reads/previews one selected PDF; provider download possible; no writes.
// Target: iPadOS/Jellycuts versions must be recorded; previous profile iPadOS 26.6 / Jellycuts 2026.6.4. Local comparison Open-Jellycore e1ec31c / Swift 6.4.1.
// Stage: Candidate, not iPad compiled/imported/executed. Local build results: generation-groups-builds.md. Test instructions/results: generation-groups.md.
// Setup: No native fixture slots. Import unchanged first; do not repair before recording the untouched result.
import Shortcuts

selectFile(type: Files, multiple: false) >> sentFile
getType(input: sentFile) >> baselineType
quicklook(input: baselineType)
runShortcut(name: "TEST - G3 Exit Echo", input: sentFile, show: false) >> returnedFile
getType(input: returnedFile) >> returnedType
quicklook(input: returnedType)
quicklook(input: returnedFile)
